on |\n|---|----------|-------------|\n| N1 | `subscribe(userId)` registers user | `getNotifications(userId)` available (empty initially) |\n| N2 | Order created for subscribed user generates notification | Notification with type `order_created` appears |\n| N3 | Order status change for subscribed user generates notification | Notification with type `order_status_changed` |\n| N4 | Payment processed for subscribed user generates notification | Notification with type `payment_processed` |\n| N5 | Non-subscribed user gets no notifications | Empty array |\n| N6 | `notification:sent` event emitted when notification recorded | Bus has event with userId, type, message |\n\n## Analytics Service (`createAnalyticsService`)\n\n| # | Behavior | Verification |\n|---|----------|-------------|\n| A1 | `getEventCount(eventType)` returns count of events by type | Count matches emitted events |\n| A2 | `getRevenue()` returns sum of totals from successful payments | Matches totals of successful orders |\n| A3 | Revenue only from successful payments — failed/timeout don't count | Revenue unchanged after failure |\n| A4 | `getConversionRate()` returns orders / carts created | Correct ratio |\n| A5 | `getConversionRate()` with no carts returns 0 | 0, not NaN |\n| A6 | `getTopProducts(n)` returns top n products by order quantity | Sorted desc, limited to n |\n| A7 | Empty analytics returns empty top products | `getTopProducts(5)` returns [] |\n\n## Cross-Service Integration\n\n| # | Behavior | Verification |\n|---|----------|-------------|\n| X1 | Services don't import from each other | No imports between service files |\n| X2 | All 8 factories exported from `src/index.ts` | Named exports exist |\n\n## Build & Lint\n\n| # | Behavior | Verification |\n|---|----------|-------------|\n| B1 | `npm run build` compiles with zero errors | tsc exit code 0 |\n| B2 | `npm run lint` passes with zero errors | eslint exit code 0 |\n"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9